## 📖 Loyiha haqida

Bu loyiha nima muammoni hal qiladi va nima uchun yaratilgan? 2-3 jumlada yozing.

## 🎯 Asosiy imkoniyatlar

| Imkoniyat | Tavsif |
|-----------|--------|
| 🔐 Autentifikatsiya | Ro'yxatdan o'tish va tizimga kirish |
| 📝 CRUD amallari | Ma'lumot qo'shish, o'zgartirish, o'chirish |
| 🔎 Qidiruv | Tezkor qidiruv va filtrlash |
| 📱 Moslashuvchan dizayn | Telefon va kompyuterda to'g'ri ishlaydi |

## 🧰 Tech Stack

| Qism | Texnologiyalar |
|------|----------------|
| **Frontend** | HTML, CSS, JavaScript |
| **Backend** | Python, Django |
| **Ma'lumotlar bazasi** | PostgreSQL |
| **Deploy** | Render / Vercel / Railway |

## 🚀 Ishga tushirish

```bash
# Klonlash
git clone https://github.com/USERNAME/REPO-NOMI.git
cd REPO-NOMI

# Virtual muhit yaratish
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate      # Windows: venv\Scripts\activate

# Kutubxonalarni o'rnatish
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Migratsiyalar va serverni ishga tushirish
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver
```

Brauzerda oching: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`

## 🔧 Muhit o'zgaruvchilari

`.env` faylini yarating:

```env
SECRET_KEY=sizning_maxfiy_kalitingiz
DEBUG=True
DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@localhost:5432/dbname
```

